  "name": "luh-does-apple-replant-disease-ard-affect-the-soil-patch-selection-behaviour-of-collembolans",
  "notes": "All data are analysed and published 2020 under the title \"Does apple replant disease affect the soil patch selection behaviour and population growth of Collembolans?\" in the Journal of Applied Entomology (2022); https://doi.org/10.1111/jen.13078\r\nThe data are also part of the MSc-Thesis of Wadu Thanthri Nilupuli Thushangi (International Horticulture) with the title: \"Interaction of Soil Mesofauna (Collembola) with Apple Replant Disease\" from 2018 at Institute of Horticultural production Systems, Sec. Phytomedicine. All data are count data of recaptured Collembola in soil substrates. \r\n\r\nDetailed methods of data collection and analysis are desribed in the paper and MSc thesis as mentioned above. The files were created by MS Excel 2016.\r\n",
